#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:2
msgid "Detect forest, trees and shrub vegetation from 0.6-0.3 m satellite imagery. Covers sparse forest, shrubland, small tree groups and narrow tree lines."
msgstr "从 0.6-0.3 米卫星影像中识别森林、树木与灌木植被，涵盖稀疏林地、灌木丛、小片树群和狭长林带。"

